# Normalize all text files to LF on checkout, regardless of platform or a
# developer's global core.autocrlf setting. Module overlay files (BUILD.bazel,
# .bzl, etc.) are served to Bazel via local file:// registry URLs and their
# SHA256 integrity hashes are computed against the LF blob content, so a
# CRLF checkout (the Windows git default) breaks every local registry fetch.
* text=auto eol=lf
